150	    /// Routes `git log` (the `commits_since` short-circuit) and `git diff
151	    /// --quiet` (the exact fallback check) to independently canned
152	    /// responses, counting each kind of invocation separately and
153	    /// recording the exact args of the most recent call of each kind so
